# Runtime/editor debris should never become part of an unattended backup.
**/.cache/
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.bak
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

# Common credential formats. Add encrypted examples instead of real secrets.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
